'''Unincorporated''' is a [[Location]] containing a large tall door of wood flanked on both sides by statues. It is located behind the {{Zone|Mountain}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Unincorporated''' area, despite its name, is a place where level 6 {{MobSprite|Skeleton (Unincorporated)|alt=Skeleton}} spawn at night. When killed, they drop an extra {{Item|bone}} that is not affected by Auto Pickup. If this bone is not picked up by a player within a short amount of time, the item will vanish and a skeleton will appear in its place. 

Due to the high amount of [[mobs]] that can spawn, this is a popular spot to grind for [[Purple Candy|Candy]] during the [[Spooky Festival]].

During the [[Great Spook]], {{MobSprite|Vargul the Unearthed}} and his gravestone appears here.

